{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driving License? Never heard of it</strong>, is a physics based driving game set in a city where all drivers apparently got their driving licenses out of cereal boxes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 16 different cars, with various types of performance upgrades that can be purchased and installed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with performance upgrades, there are also <i>abilities.</i>\u00a0These abilities help you deal with the absolute insanity that you will find on the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has a story that the player uncovers through characters, and different types of driving and racing events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please give us a whishlist if you think thi could be something you enjoy, It helps a great deal.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you :)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694340?t=1747935038","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694340?t=1747935038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694340/5b68dea565c1f0c31992baa387f827a822d3127b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747935038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694340/5b68dea565c1f0c31992baa387f827a822d3127b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747935038","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driving License? Never heard of it</strong>, is a physics based driving game set in a city where all drivers apparently got their driving licenses out of cereal boxes.\u00a0</p>